[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0010","text":"——啊……\n那位老师……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0020","text":"啊～，是之前那个人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0040","text":"…………嗯，嗯！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0050","text":"雏、雏菜酱\n谢谢你陪我一起复习考试！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0060","text":"雏菜酱也\n考了超好的成绩呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0070","text":"……走，走吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0080","text":"真是的～……\n明明不用跑这么急的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0090","text":"对、对不起……\n呼……我、我……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12200100_02_0100","text":"我，还是第一次\n反抗老师……！"}]
